      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "Choose one of the following combat maneuvers: disarm, repositionAPG, stealAPG, sunder, or trip. You gain a +2 bonus when performing the selected maneuver while wielding an Aldori dueling sword. This bonus does not stack with the bonus provided by a combat maneuver feat with “improved” in its name (such as Improved Trip)."
